t, speaking and networking.","image":{"src":"/themes/spotlight-coach/place-1.svg","alt":"From quiet expert to trusted voice"},"points":[{"title":"Clarity","text":"Know exactly what you stand for and who you serve.","icon":"mic"},{"title":"Confidence","text":"Speak and write in your own authentic voice.","icon":"target"},{"title":"Consistency","text":"A simple weekly routine that fits busy schedules.","icon":"rocket"},{"title":"Community","text":"Connect with ambitious, generous peers.","icon":"sparkles"}],"button":{"label":"About us","href":"/about"}}},{"type":"day-timeline","props":{"eyebrow":"How it works","title":"Your coaching journey","text":"Four stages from first call to confident presence.","items":[{"time":"Step 1","title":"Discover","text":"We define your story, strengths and audience.","icon":"mic"},{"time":"Step 2","title":"Design","text":"We shape your message and signature topics.","icon":"target"},{"time":"Step 3","title":"Show up","text":"You start publishing and speaking with support.","icon":"rocket"},{"time":"Step 4","title":"Grow","text":"We review results and scale what works.","icon":"sparkles"}]}},{"type":"teachers","props":{"eyebrow":"Our team","title":"The Spotlight team","members":[{"name":"Maya Kapoor","role":"Founder & Coach","image":{"src":"/themes/spotlight-coach/person-1.svg","alt":"Maya Kapoor"}},{"name":"Aditya Rao","role":"Content Strategist","image":{"src":"/themes/spotlight-coach/person-2.svg","alt":"Aditya Rao"}},{"name":"Sophie Laurent","role":"Speaking Coach","image":{"src":"/themes/spotlight-coach/person-3.svg","alt":"Sophie Laurent"}},{"name":"Nisha Patel","role":"Community Manager","image":{"src":"/themes/spotlight-coach/person-4.svg","alt":"Nisha Patel"}}]}},{"type":"testimonials","props":{"heading":"What our clients say","items":[{"quote":"Within three months I was invited to speak at two industry conferences.","author":"Rhea Malhotra","role":"Product Leader"},{"quote":"Maya helped me find my voice. My LinkedIn audience gr